'''Absol''' (Japanese: '''アブソル''' ''Absol'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

