==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Champion's Path|Absol|38}} from the {{TCG|Champion's Path}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Absol|164}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Leap Over''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Jump Over''' on {{TCG ID|Wizards Promo|Rapidash|51}} from the {{TCG|Wizards Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

